WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.960
All we did was automate what good networkers do every day.

2
00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:07.280
Because good networkers

3
00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:11.930
do this every single day, consistently, basically machines,

4
00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:13.700
war machines, I call them.

5
00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:17.930
Except it's really hard.

6
00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:24.500
You have to be impressively organised. This software

7
00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:30.970
comes from Gabriele's experience, and a bit from mine too, the technical side.

8
00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:33.310
Gabriele as the leader:

9
00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:38.810
together we put both kinds of knowledge into practice and created something that helps,

10
00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:40.350
day by day,

11
00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:43.790
to do what people should do but don't.

12
00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:47.270
Simply, quickly and effectively.
